		description: 'WIP - Designed and developed an online platform for a small financial advisory business, providing them with a professional website and an established digital presence. This comprehensive project spanned from initial research to the final implementation, ensuring a seamless transition to the online world.',
		tags: ['WordPress', 'HTML', 'CSS', 'JavaScript'],
		links: [
			{
